OL,3,GNEWSAAnglian Water 'requires
OL,4,Aimprovement' again
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnglian Water has been criticised for
OL,7,Fits environmental impact and told it
OL,8,F"requires improvement" for the fifth
OL,9,Fyear in a row.
OL,11,FThe company, which provides water
OL,12,Fsupply and sewage treatment across the
OL,13,Feast of England, was inspected by
OL,14,Fregulators.
OL,16,FThe firm registered 12 "serious
OL,17,Fpollution incidents" in 2025, its
OL,18,Fsecond highest figure of the last 14
OL,19,Fyears.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
