OL,3,GNEWSAAnglian Water 'requires
OL,4,Aimprovement' again
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Anglian Water spokesperson said: "We
OL,7,Fare making great progress in the
OL,8,Fdelivery of our biggest ever investment
OL,9,Fprogramme, with over #2bn due to be
OL,10,Fspent on environmental improvements
OL,11,Fright across the east of England
OL,12,Fthrough to 2030."
